              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "49.3-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunini nama Reubeniini, angafi Yakobo d'ale. (Waan Reubeni duri gaarayu abba isa barateefi, angaftiti isaa iraa fud'aani Yusufu kennani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.49.8+GEN.49.9+GEN.49.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Uum 49.8-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ammo hataatuti, gochiti Yuda gosa taani ch'ufa iraa jabaate hayyu iti taate.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angafi Yakobo Reubeniini, ilmaani d'iira afuri qaba: Hanoki, Palu, Hesroni, Karmi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
