              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Hay 15.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Tunini ilmaani Yoeli aka isiini woli gula aante d'alate gula: Shemaya, Gogu, Shimei, Mika, Reaya, Baali, Beera. Hayyuuni Ashuru ka Tiglath-Pileseri jed'ani, gudda gosa suni ka Beara jed'ani qabe boojie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.4+1CH.5.5+1CH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.4",
              "1CH.5.5",
              "1CH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.4+1CH.5.5+1CH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.4",
              "1CH.5.5",
              "1CH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunini maqa worra gugurda balbala gosa Reubeni, ka t'aafani: Yeieli, Zekaria, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bela, ilma Azazi, ilma Shemaya, ka balbala Yoeli worri balbala tana kunini Aroerifi lafa artini mirga, ta qajeela Nebotifi Beala Meoni, keesa taa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri hori gudda qaba, lafa Gileadi keesa, tanaafi lafa haga lafa gamooji ta ilaboruti ejite haga galaana Efratiti Ejitu ch'ufa fud'ate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bara Sauloni lafa fide, gochiti Reubeni gosa Hajiri haate, dabsate hobaafte, lafa worra gama Gileadini ilaboru fud'ate keesa qubate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nama Gadini d'ale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gochiti Gadi, gosa Reubenitini mirgaa, lafa Bashani ta haga Salekati ejite keesa teeti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoelini gudda gosa worraa, isale Shafamuti iti aana, Yanafi Shafathiti, lafa Baashani keesa, worrati aana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gochiti Gadi balbala torba d'ibi qabdi: Mikaeli, Meshulamu, Sheba, Yorai, Yakani, Zia, Eberi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "worri kunini d'aloota Abiali, ka ilma Huri, ka ababooti isaa tana: Abiaheli, Huri, Yaroa, Gileadi, Mikaeli, Yehishai, Yado, Buzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahini, ilmi Abdieli, ka ilma Guni, gudda balbala gosa tanaati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri kunini lafa Bashanitifi Gileaditifi dira d'aatu jirutifi lafa horini oolu ta Sharoni jed'ani keesa taa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Dubbi tana bara Yothamuni Yuda fideefi Yeruboamuni Israeli fide t'aafani.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Askarti worra gosa ilaboru",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gosa Reubenitifi ta Gaditifi ta Manase ta ilaboru keesa, askarti kuma afurtami afuritiifi d'ibba torbafi jaatamati jira, ta ch'ufti nama wonteefi sheeftifi t'iyaani wohad'u beekhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Askartini sunini ch'ufti gosa Hajiri, ta Yeturifi Nafishifi Nodabu jed'ani, had'u dat'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Waaqa abbadate qarqaarsa kad'ate, Waaqileeni kad'acha suni d'agaye gosa Hajiritifi goli worrale worra dabsachiise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri nyaapa suni ira, gaala kuma shantamatifi hooliye kuma d'ibba lamafi shantamatifi harrelee kuma lamatiifi nama kuma d'ibba tokole boojie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan Waaqi worra qarqaareefi worri nyaapa heddu fit'e, lafa sunile fud'ate keesa tae; duuba eege nyaapa d'ibiini d'ufe worrale boojie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Worra gosa Manase ka ilaboru",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri gosa Manase, ka ilaboru lafa Baashani, haga Baal-Hermoni qubate Senirifi gaara Hermoniti eje, achiti worri hore lafa ira dabre. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri kunini abbooti balbala gosa worra: Eferi, Ishi, Elieli, Azrieli, Yeremia, Hodavia, Yadieli. Worri kunini ch'ufti nama woraana jajaba gurra qabu, ka ammalle mata balbala gosa worra.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka gosa ilaboru teetu boojiani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
